// observant, manipulative, sharp tongued, and ran both a tea house and a brothel. Likes books.
// Poisoned along much of her staff due to her tea house's water supply becoming contaminated
// self-made businesswoman, ruthless and intelligent.
// speaks in double meanings, reads people like ledgers, poker is her natural element.
// occasionally shows a protective side toward the "girls" — the staff who died with her.
// file: madam_song, speaker: Madam Song

